ing team scores in  the top of the inning on a home run game  over but if they score on a scratch  single or a sacrifice fly then the home  team gets to bat in the bottom of the  inning it's absurd on its face and I  knew that eventually I don't know how  they dodged the bullet this long but  eventually it was going to come back to  bite them in a Super Bowl and it did  it's just a dumb way to conclude a great  game well this is a way to conclude this  interview as well Bob I thank you for  all the advice with the Olympics and  you'll be missed but I'm sure you'll be  you  around I'll be around thanks Dan Thank  You bud that's uh Bob costis Major  League Baseball Network and still  contributing to NBC the Dan Patrick show  weekday mornings on audience  [Music]

